      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you've experienced a minor concussion, so the most important thing is to take it easy. Try to sit in a dark, quiet room and avoid bright lights and screens for a while. If the dizziness persists, you need to stop what you're doing and consider seeing a healthcare professional.",
